<title>PHILIPPINES: Rizal Bank sets 17.50 centavo cash div.</title>
<headline>Rizal Bank sets 17.50 centavo cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rizal Commercial Banking Corp said on Tuesday its board had approved a 17.5 centavo cash dividend to cover the first half of 1997.</p>
<p>The record date is yet to be approved by the Central Bank of the Philippines.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
